{"label_alt_en":["Draft scheme of the Committee : organisation: Art. 4","organisation: Art. 4"],"label_alt_fr":["Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction : organisation: Art. 4","organisation: Art. 4"],"broader":[{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null}],"id":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-4","issues":[],"pages":[564,605,622,633],"pref_en":"Draft scheme: organisation, article 4","pref_fr":"Avant-projet : organisation, article 4","printed":["t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.organisation-art-4"],"related":[],"label_scope_note_en":"The Committee considered article 4 of the organisation section of the draft scheme.","type":"concept","direct_count":5,"propagated_count":5,"breadcrumb_paths":[[{"id":"facet.committee","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Travaux du Comité","pref_en":"The Committee's own work","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-4","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet : organisation, article 4","pref_en":"Draft scheme: organisation, article 4","is_facet":null}],[{"id":"facet.nature","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Nature et établissement de la Cour","pref_en":"Nature & establishment of the Court","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-4","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet : organisation, article 4","pref_en":"Draft scheme: organisation, article 4","is_facet":null}]],"narrower":[],"printed_entries":[{"entries":[{"article_ref":{"art":"4","part":"organisation","range":null},"label_heading":"Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction","id":"fr.0027.09","lang":"fr","qualifier":null,"raw":"Art. 4 — 554, 595, 612, 623.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":564,"printed":554,"raw":"554","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":605,"printed":595,"raw":"595","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":622,"printed":612,"raw":"612","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":633,"printed":623,"raw":"623","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":776,"sub":"organisation: Art. 4"},{"article_ref":{"art":"4","part":"organisation","range":null},"label_heading":"Draft scheme of the Committee","id":"en.0075.09","lang":"en","qualifier":null,"raw":"Art. 4 — 554, 595, 612, 623.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":564,"printed":554,"raw":"554","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":605,"printed":595,"raw":"595","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":622,"printed":612,"raw":"612","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":633,"printed":623,"raw":"623","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":782,"sub":"organisation: Art. 4"}],"id":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.organisation-art-4","label_en":"organisation: Art. 4","label_fr":"organisation: Art. 4","n_pages":4,"pages":[564,605,622,633],"parent":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction","printed_en_id":"en.0075.09","printed_fr_id":"fr.0027.09","see":[],"type":"article"}],"groups":[{"meeting":25,"section":"25","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0564.05","meeting":25,"doc":"minutes","pdf":564,"printed":554,"texts":{"fr":"M. FERNANDES soulève la question de la durée du mandat du juge élu pour remplacer un juge sorti ou décédé. A son avis le remplaçant ne devrait siéger que pour le reste du temps du mandat de son prédécesseur, pour les raisons déjà données par lui à ce sujet dans une des séances précédentes.","en":"M. FERNANDES raised the question of the period for which judges, elected to replace judges who had retired or died, should be appointed. In his opinion the successor should only take his seat for the unexpired portion of his predecessor's appointment, for the reasons he had already given at a previous meeting.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0564.05","speaker_id":"fernandes","certain":true,"name":"Raul Fernandes","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-4","weight":1.0,"end":135,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":4391,"start":36}]},{"seg_id":"s0564.07","meeting":25,"doc":"minutes","pdf":564,"printed":554,"texts":{"fr":"M. ALTAMIRA demande s'il ne serait pas utile de consigner dans cet article la faculté pour les juges de démissionner; mais on est d'accord pour reconnaître qu'une stipulation expresse à cet effet n'est pas nécessaire.","en":"M. ALTAMIRA asked whether it would not be advisable to mention in this Article that judges would have the right to resign: however, it was agreed that an explicit stipulation to this effect was unnecessary.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0564.07","speaker_id":"altamira","certain":true,"name":"Rafael Altamira","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-4","weight":1.0,"end":121,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":4393,"start":55}]},{"seg_id":"s0571.13","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":571,"printed":561,"texts":{"fr":"Les membres de la Cour sont élus pour neuf ans. Ils sont rééligibles.","en":"The members of the Court shall be elected for nine years. They may be re-elected.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-4","weight":1.0,"end":56,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":4448,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0571.14","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":571,"printed":561,"texts":{"fr":"Ils restent en fonction jusqu'à leur remplacement effectif. Même après ce remplacement, ils continuent de connaître des affaires dont ils sont déjà saisis.","en":"They shall continue to discharge their duties until their places have actually been filled. Though replaced, they shall complete any cases which they may have begun.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-4","weight":1.0,"end":90,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":4451,"start":0}]}]},{"meeting":32,"section":"32","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0683.12","meeting":32,"doc":"annex","pdf":683,"printed":673,"texts":{"fr":"Les membres de la Cour sont élus par l'Assemblée et par le Conseil sur une liste de personnes présentées par les groupes nationaux de la Cour d'Arbitrage, conformément aux dispositions suivantes.","en":"The members of the Court shall be elected by the Assembly and the Council from a list of persons nominated by the national groups in the Court of Arbitration, in accordance with the following provisions.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-4","weight":1.0,"end":73,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":5232,"start":0}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"count":0},{"meeting":5,"count":0},{"meeting":6,"count":0},{"meeting":7,"count":0},{"meeting":8,"count":0},{"meeting":9,"count":0},{"meeting":10,"count":0},{"meeting":11,"count":0},{"meeting":12,"count":0},{"meeting":13,"count":0},{"meeting":14,"count":0},{"meeting":15,"count":0},{"meeting":16,"count":0},{"meeting":17,"count":0},{"meeting":18,"count":0},{"meeting":19,"count":0},{"meeting":20,"count":0},{"meeting":21,"count":0},{"meeting":22,"count":0},{"meeting":23,"count":0},{"meeting":24,"count":0},{"meeting":25,"count":4},{"meeting":26,"count":0},{"meeting":27,"count":0},{"meeting":28,"count":0},{"meeting":29,"count":0},{"meeting":30,"count":0},{"meeting":31,"count":0},{"meeting":32,"count":1},{"meeting":33,"count":0},{"meeting":34,"count":0},{"meeting":35,"count":0}],"members":[{"id":"fernandes","name":"Raul Fernandes","count":1},{"id":"altamira","name":"Rafael Altamira","count":1}],"p